  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n ((0.026)³ - (0.02)³)/((0.026)² + 0.00052 + (0.02)²) \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n a³ - b³ = (a - b)(a² + ab + b²) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n Rightarrow ((0.026 - 0.02)(0.026² + 0.026 times 0.02 + 0.02²))/(0.026² + 0.00052 + 0.02²) \n\n Rightarrow ((0.006)(0.026² + 0.00052 + 0.02²))/(0.026² + 0.00052 + 0.02²) \n\n Rightarrow 0.006 \n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.006 **",
